abstract: >-
  An experimental Lean 4 formalization of the foundations of Boolean-valued set
  theory and Boolean-valued analysis, including Boolean-valued semantics, mixing
  and maximum principles, a separated Boolean-valued universe, ZF/ZFC transfer
  infrastructure, internal reals, and Boolean spectral families.
keywords:
  - "Lean 4"
  - "formalized mathematics"
  - "Boolean-valued analysis"
  - "Boolean-valued models"
  - "set theory"
  - "forcing"
